{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-02_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-02","title":"一些誤會","storyCode":"6-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-02_end.txt","sourceHash":"a7e650bdef2c60c4b1fd778d6920e22ace65943a4f9d8fd15da9a2e9679fd917","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_building_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我也不是打了你就不當你是同胞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，這話我自己說了都不信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，通報Blaze-4號小隊，俘獲十數個整合運動成員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"有機會的話就來接收，沒時間就交給龍門當局了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊的龍門人，把弩放下。沒必要那麼警戒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我是哪裡還得不到你們的信任？我甚至救了你們一命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"退後......！我知道，可、可你......感染者......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，是啊。是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，走了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，算了。Dr.{@nickname}，過來。別動，這樣快點。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你還好吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，看來是習慣讓我拎著你跑路了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"別用那種眼神看我，說了，我好著呢，這種事發生過不知道多少次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我們去十六區的橫山廣場吧。整合運動想要突破防線的話，那裡是必經之道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......想要趁勢一舉殲滅整合運動的主要力量，就不能放跑任何一支控制區裡的整合運動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"按照阿米婭和那個老氣橫秋的陳警官的策略，大部分整合運動會被我們這樣一點點消磨乾淨，最後只要打一場殲滅戰就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"先把橫山大廈裡的敵人逼出來，讓他們逃進包圍圈，再去和阿米婭他們會合，一路上順手打打整合運動。簡單明瞭吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......別這種表情啊，我不是說我好得很嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哎。你要是再這麼盯著我看，我可要直接賴在馬路當中不走了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"抓緊點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪......你看那邊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"那是梅菲斯特的牧群嗎？怎麼這也有，他們不應該是由梅菲斯特親自帶領嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。等等？他們......他們為什麼在打自己人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然一直能收到生理訊息，但怎麼一條定時通報都收不到？也沒有緊急訊號的發送跡象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"究竟出了什麼事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"不好好指揮戰鬥，站在那看什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不關你事，“小姐”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，也太小氣了點吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定不能給你看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜你有線人斷線了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能別在這種事情上浪費你的直覺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"至少說中了你就會往下說嘛。感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......你懷疑他叛逃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"絕不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"那你懷疑的就是這個“絕對不可能”囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她真的叛逃了......那種後果，我連想都不敢想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，如果她會背叛龍門，整個龍門就沒有任何一個人是值得信賴的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像猜到是誰了欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......她會願意去做這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"她？幹這個？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["詩懷雅"]}]}
